{
  "slug": "design-is-code",
  "name": "Design Is Code",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Transform UML sequence diagrams and decision tables into Java tests and code. The DisC methodology applies London-school TDD to AI code generation: every design arrow becomes a verify() test and every decision-table row becomes one leaf test, so mockist tests pin call structure, order, and arguments — leaving no room for AI interpretation. Phase 1 generates tests from the design; Phase 2 derives the implementation from the tests alone. Currently supports Java + Spring Boot with PlantUML sequence diagrams and Markdown decision tables.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `disc` (Transform a precise design (UML sequence diagrams and decision tables) into working code using the DisC methodology).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install design-is-code@claude-community` from `mossgreen/design-is-code-plugin`.\n\nA methodology where design generates tests, and tests constrain AI-generated code.",
  "compatibility": [
